# Scripts

- Tests live in `scripts/test_*.py` and run under `python3 -m unittest discover -s scripts -p 'test_*.py'`. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- `scripts/deploy/*.sh` publish the live site. Deploys go through the GitHub Actions workflows. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- After editing `contracts/*.json`, run `sync-contracts.py` and `check-contracts.py`. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
- Do not add plaintext entries to `scripts/pii-denylist.sha256`. [why: convention from the sibling repository]
